WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.200
A café scene containing generated articulated objects.

00:04.200 --> 00:10.200
Two-group espresso machine: trays, portafilters and steam wands.

00:10.200 --> 00:15.300
Coffee grinder: hopper lid, adjustment collar and catch tray.

00:15.300 --> 00:21.000
A metal cabinet opens and closes its doors.

00:21.000 --> 00:27.000
A second espresso machine demonstrates its movable parts.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
The camera returns to the complete café scene.
